# Convex Vector Search Rules

- Embeddings are stored as `v.array(v.float64())` with dimension 1536 (OpenAI text-embedding-3-small).
- Vector search is only allowed inside Convex actions.
- Use the vector index name `by_embedding` on the `chunks` table.
- Available filter fields in the index: `documentId`, `pageNumber`, `chapter`.
- Use internal query `getChunksByIds` to load docs by IDs returned from vector search.
- Prefer filtering inside the vector search filter where possible; do additional narrowing after loading results if needed (e.g., page ranges).
